tick=5 row=2 write no-op precondition=no-change
tick=5 retryblock target=svc-a-engine-367ef4b7 persist nil→{state=Backoff attempts=1 nextRetryAt=t+1m0s reason=replacement gang (surge-index=2) lost 2 of 2 member(s) after it took over serving}
