tick=6 event Normal GangSurgeAbandoned OMENative component=engine instance=0 abandoned gang surge (surge-index=2): the roll target moved off revision svc-a-engine-367ef4b7 while the replacement gang was short of members, so nothing is rebuilt at it; the source's pods are gone and it re-enters as a fresh start at the roll target
